          {
            "start_line": 32,
            "end_line": 35,
            "line_count": 4,
            "preview": "// The override's enabled feature takes precedence, so the merged value // equals the \"enabled\" value, though it is a freshly created instance. assertTrue(merged.equals((Object) featureEnabled));"
